OL,3,AJury discharged in Palestine Action
OL,4,AElbit raid trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been discharged in the trial
OL,7,Fof eight Palestine Action activists who
OL,8,Fwere accused of helping to organise a
OL,9,Fraid on the UK site of an Israel-based
OL,10,Fdefence firm.
OL,12,FIan Sanders, Aleksandra Herbich, Teuta
OL,13,FHoxha, Sean Middleborough, Julija
OL,14,FBrigadirova, Hannah Davidson, Madeleine
OL,15,FNorman and William Plastow were charged
OL,16,Fwith criminal damage after a raid on
OL,17,FElbit Systems in Filton, near Bristol,
OL,18,Fin August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
